<view class="page"><view class="subject-banner"><text>就诊人：{{patientName||'请先选择'}}</text><view>{{patientCapacity}}</view><navigator url="/pages/patients/index" open-type="reLaunch">切换就诊人</navigator></view><view class="title">方案与本人决定</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error" role="alert">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{done}}" class="notice">{{done}}</view><view wx:if="{{busy}}" class="notice">正在核对…</view><view wx:if="{{readOnly}}" class="notice">当前环境只供查阅。</view><block wx:if="{{plan}}"><view class="card"><view class="section-title">{{plan.clinic}} · V{{plan.version}} {{plan.is_current?'当前方案':'保留历史'}}</view><view class="line">{{plan.summary}}</view><view class="line">{{plan.discussion_note}}</view><view class="muted">{{plan.timeLabel}}</view><view>估算不等于最终账单，互斥选项不直接相加。本人决定用于本版本讨论，专项知情同意另行办理。</view></view><view class="row"><button class="secondary" bindtap="version" disabled="{{busy||uncertain}}">当前方案</button><button wx:for="{{plan.versions}}" wx:key="*this" data-revision="{{item}}" bindtap="version" disabled="{{busy||uncertain}}">V{{item}}</button></view><view wx:for="{{plan.steps}}" wx:key="id" class="card"><view class="section-title">第 {{item.sequence}} 步 · {{item.treatment}}</view><view class="line">{{item.description}}</view><view>目标：{{item.goal}}</view><view>{{item.service.name}}<text wx:if="{{item.tooth}}"> · FDI {{item.tooth}} {{item.surface}}</text></view><view>预计 {{item.estimated_quantity}} {{item.unit}} · {{item.estimate_amount===null?'费用待评估':'预计 ¥'+item.estimate_amount}}</view><view>{{item.estimate_note}}</view><view>{{item.charge_basis_label}}<text wx:if="{{item.alternative_group}}"> · 互斥组 {{item.alternative_group}}</text></view><view class="notice">本版本决定：{{item.decision?item.decision.label:'待本人核对'}}<view wx:if="{{item.decision}}">{{item.decision.note}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{item.completed}}">此步骤已有实际完成记录。</view><button wx:if="{{plan.is_current && !readOnly}}" class="secondary" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="choose" disabled="{{busy||uncertain}}">核对此步骤的本人决定</button><view wx:for="{{item.actual_history}}" wx:for-item="actual" wx:key="id" class="line">{{actual.timeLabel}} · {{actual.progress_label}} · {{actual.mode_label}} · {{actual.state_label}}</view></view>
<view wx:if="{{selected}}" class="card"><view class="section-title">V{{plan.version}} 第 {{selected.sequence}} 步 · 本人决定</view><view>{{selected.description}}</view><picker range="{{states}}" range-key="label" value="{{stateIndex}}" bindchange="pick" disabled="{{busy||uncertain}}"><view class="picker">{{states[stateIndex].label}} ▼</view></picker><label for="decision-note">决定说明／后续安排</label><textarea id="decision-note" value="{{note}}" maxlength="1000" bindinput="input" disabled="{{busy||uncertain}}" placeholder="暂缓或不选择时，请说明原因或后续安排"/><button bindtap="preview" disabled="{{busy||uncertain}}">预览我的决定</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="cancel" disabled="{{busy||uncertain}}">返回查看方案</button></view>
<view wx:if="{{preview}}" class="card"><view class="section-title">确认 V{{preview.version}} 的具体步骤</view><view>{{preview.description}}</view><view>{{preview.decisionLabel}}</view><view>{{preview.values.note}}</view><checkbox-group bindchange="checked"><label><checkbox value="yes" checked="{{checked}}" disabled="{{busy||uncertain}}"/>已核对这个版本步骤及本人决定</label></checkbox-group><view wx:if="{{uncertain}}" class="notice">刚才的结果尚未确认。保留原提交内容，可重试核对同一决定。</view><button bindtap="confirm" disabled="{{busy}}">{{uncertain?'重试核对原提交结果':'明确确认本人决定'}}</button></view>
<view wx:if="{{plan.instructions.length}}" class="card"><view class="section-title">本店后续安排</view><view wx:for="{{plan.instructions}}" wx:key="id" class="line"><view>{{item.service}} · {{item.earliest_on}} 至 {{item.latest_on}}</view><view>{{item.purpose}}</view></view><view>可查询服务时段，或联系前台协调。预约成功不表示已经完成复诊。</view><navigator url="/pages/services/index">查看服务与时段 →</navigator></view></block><button class="secondary" bindtap="load" disabled="{{busy||uncertain}}">刷新当前方案</button></view>
